{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>布魯可被控股股東減持，套現超過2.5億元。</p><p></p><p>公司董事長朱偉松持股公司，於本月22日透過大宗交易方式，以每股65.28元，即較上日收市價折讓百分之6作價，出售384.9萬股，佔已發行股本百分之1.56。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:02.960287+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:00.828802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:43.057321+00:00","content_hash":"354878b1db4d1f19a6e4aab954f5aa40796061946fb908cabff67ae519c37f68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}